claude/settings.json
claude/CLAUDE.md
claude/RTK.md
claude/memory/
ssh/

# Never in any repo
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
**/credentials
**/*service*account*.json
**/application_default_credentials.json
.claude.json
hosts.yml
